OL,4,BShelton moves closer to ATP Finals     
OL,5,Blast-four spot                         
OL,6,GBen Shelton battled past Rafael Jodar  
OL,7,Gto move within touching distance of a  
OL,8,Gplace in the ATP Finals last four.     
OL,10,FUS Open runner-up Shelton only lost    
OL,11,Fhis serve once but still had to fight  
OL,12,Ffor just over two hours to beat the    
OL,13,Ffast-rising Spaniard 7-6 (10-8) 7-5.   
OL,15,FAmerican Shelton closed out the match  
OL,16,Fwith three aces in a row and then      
OL,17,Fwrote "I'll be watching, Arthur" on    
OL,18,Fthe camera lens - a reference to the   
OL,19,Ffinal game in the group.               
